      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean implementing all 3 modes: append, skip, and overwrite? Is there a use case for that?\n\nAlso, how do you think they should work in relation to request headers? Right now, the Add() method only compares urls, while Merge() also looks at headers.",
